---
import ContentPage from '../components/ContentPage.astro';
import { SITE_URL } from '../data/site';

const TITLE = 'About Us - gifmememaker.com | Free Meme Maker Online';
const DESCRIPTION =
  'Meet gifmememaker.com, the free meme maker online for AI captions, GIF memes and video memes. Fast, private and 100% browser-based — no signup.';
const PATH = '/about-us/';

const breadcrumb = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
  itemListElement: [
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'Home', item: `${SITE_URL}/` },
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: 'About Us', item: `${SITE_URL}${PATH}` },
  ],
};

const aboutSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'AboutPage',
  name: 'About gifmememaker.com',
  url: `${SITE_URL}${PATH}`,
  description: DESCRIPTION,
  inLanguage: 'en',
  mainEntity: {
    '@type': 'Organization',
    name: 'gifmememaker.com',
    url: `${SITE_URL}/`,
    description:
      'gifmememaker.com builds free, browser-based meme making tools — an online meme maker with AI captions, a GIF meme maker and a video meme maker.',
  },
};
---

<ContentPage
  title={TITLE}
  description={DESCRIPTION}
  path={PATH}
  eyebrow="About Us"
  h1="About gifmememaker.com — The Free Meme Maker Built for Creators"
  jsonLd={[breadcrumb, aboutSchema]}
>
  <h2>Who We Are</h2>
  <p>
    gifmememaker.com is an independent, browser-based <strong>meme maker</strong> built for
    people who want to make jokes fast — not fight with software. What started as a simple top-and-bottom-text
    meme generator has grown into a full creative studio: an <strong>online meme maker</strong>, an
    <strong>AI meme maker</strong>, a <strong>GIF meme maker</strong> and a <strong>video meme maker</strong>,
    all living in a single tab of your browser.
  </p>

  <h2>Our Mission</h2>
  <p>
    Great meme tools should be instant, free and private. That is why everything here runs client-side:
    no uploads to a server, no account wall, no waiting room. Open the studio, make something funny, download
    it — that is the whole product. Whether you are a creator shipping daily content, a community manager
    looking for a reaction GIF, or a friend who just wants the perfect group-chat reply, the
    <strong>free meme maker</strong> experience is the same for everyone.
  </p>

  <h2>What You Can Create</h2>
  <p>The studio combines several tools that usually live in separate apps:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Image memes</strong> — upload a photo or start from 70+ templates, add top/bottom captions, floating text, fonts, outlines and shadows.</li>
    <li><strong>Animated GIF memes</strong> — load any GIF or convert video to GIF, trim it, retime it (0.25x–3.0x) and caption it frame by frame.</li>
    <li><strong>Video memes</strong> — drop in an MP4, WebM or MOV, cut the exact moment, add punchline text and export.</li>
    <li><strong>AI captions</strong> — let the <strong>meme maker AI</strong> write five comedic angles (humorous, relatable, tech, sarcastic, Gen Z) and click any suggestion to apply it.</li>
    <li><strong>Social formats</strong> — aspect presets for Instagram, Twitter/X and TikTok (1:1, 16:9, 9:16) so your <strong>meme maker GIF</strong> and video output never gets cropped wrong.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Why Everything Runs in Your Browser</h2>
  <p>
    Traditional meme maker apps ask you to create an account, sync your gallery and often re-upload every
    file you touch. We took the opposite approach. Canvas rendering, frame extraction, trimming and GIF
    encoding all happen locally on your device, which means your media stays <strong>private by
    default</strong>, exports start instantly, and the tool works the same on a school Chromebook as it does
    on a workstation. It also keeps the <strong>meme maker free</strong> — there are no server bills to pass
    on to you, and no ads interrupting the timeline.
  </p>

  <h2>Who It Is For</h2>
  <p>
    Our users are meme makers first: Gen Z creators, moderators, marketers, teachers, developers posting
    dev memes, and anyone who communicates in images. Some of them want the
    <strong>best meme maker app</strong> feel without installing anything; others want a quick
    <strong>meme maker online</strong> they can open on any device. Both land in the same studio.
  </p>

  <h2>Free Forever, Private by Design</h2>
  <p>
    The core tool — the <strong>free meme maker app</strong> side of things — stays free: PNG/JPG export,
    GIF export, templates, trimming, speed control and AI captions cost nothing. An optional Pro tier adds
    4K stills, MP4/WebM export and watermark removal for heavy users. Whatever tier you use, your files
    never leave your browser. That is the promise behind every meme made with gifmememaker.com.
  </p>
  <p>
    Ready to start? <a href="/#studio">Open the studio</a> or read the
    <a href="/#faq">frequently asked questions</a>. Questions about the project? Head to the
    <a href="/contact-us/">contact page</a>.
  </p>
</ContentPage>